WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:04.117
For years drug action was pictured as occupancy.

00:00:04.117 --> 00:00:04.637
Induced

00:00:04.637 --> 00:00:08.427
proximity instead asks whether a molecule can bring

00:00:08.427 --> 00:00:08.650
two

00:00:08.650 --> 00:00:10.767
biological partners together.

00:00:14.883 --> 00:00:18.916
A bifunctional agent can link a target protein to an

00:00:18.916 --> 00:00:19.071
E3

00:00:19.071 --> 00:00:22.955
ligase and initiate ubiquitination, redirecting the

00:00:22.955 --> 00:00:25.239
cell's own disposal machinery.

00:00:29.425 --> 00:00:32.965
The two proteins must form a productive complex.

00:00:32.965 --> 00:00:33.408
Linker

00:00:33.408 --> 00:00:37.174
length, orientation and cooperativity matter in ways

00:00:37.174 --> 00:00:40.144
simple binary affinity does not describe.

00:00:44.425 --> 00:00:48.091
A bridge that dissociates too fast fails to act, while

00:00:48.091 --> 00:00:51.271
one that never releases may fail to turn over.

00:00:51.271 --> 00:00:51.893
Residence

00:00:51.893 --> 00:00:53.522
time becomes functional.

00:00:57.258 --> 00:01:01.101
Induced proximity can also relocalise or stabilize a

00:01:01.101 --> 00:01:05.092
protein, revealing that the real modality is the event

00:01:05.092 --> 00:01:06.570
the molecule causes.

00:01:10.383 --> 00:01:13.747
The column follows the move from simply blocking

00:01:13.747 --> 00:01:14.308
function

00:01:14.308 --> 00:01:17.406
to engineering a testable cellular event with

00:01:17.406 --> 00:01:20.505
selectivity, exposure and resistance in view.
